# ── Serverless function budget ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Hobby plan deploys at most 12 Serverless Functions, and every file under
# api/ that is not in api/_lib/ counts as one. There are 9 now, so nothing has to
# be excluded to fit: removing Postgres also removed the two office-only endpoints
# that read its price-map table and the membership visits endpoint that read its
# contracts.
#
# NOTE: api/_lib/payment-links.js is a library, not a route, and does not count.
